<main class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">About the project</div>
<h1>Built for players who want better answers</h1>
<p>EvonyMasters is an independent, fan-made collection of tools for players of Evony: The King's Return. It brings together item sources, monster rewards, chest contents, event schedules and planning calculators so players can spend less time hunting through tables and more time making informed game decisions.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>What you can do here</h2><p>Use the <a href="/resources/">Item Finder</a> to look up reward sources, the <a href="/chests/">Chest Finder</a> to examine recorded chest contents, the <a href="/calendar/">Event Calendar</a> to check published schedules, or <a href="/loot-compass/">Loot Compass</a> to compare guaranteed reward opportunities and monster farming returns. Other tools help with troop planning and training.</p></section>
<section><h2>How we handle game data</h2><p>EvonyMasters combines recorded reward data and published event schedules. A reward classified as “Guaranteed” does not mean a player automatically receives it: qualification, chest awards, event milestones and rank conditions may still apply. Possible drops, unknown quantities and data gaps are not proof of a reward. Game rules and events can change, and our records can be incomplete.</p><p>When planning costly in-game actions, verify the latest details inside the game. If something looks wrong, please <a href="/contact/">report a correction</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Independence</h2><p>EvonyMasters is an unofficial fan site. It is not affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by or endorsed by Evony: The King's Return or its publisher. Game names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p></section>
